{"id":10071,"name":"slowbro-mega","speciesId":80,"dex":80,"form":"mega","generation":1,"types":["water","psychic"],"stats":{"hp":95,"attack":75,"defense":180,"special-attack":130,"special-defense":80,"speed":30},"abilities":[{"name":"shell-armor","hidden":false}],"height":20,"weight":1200,"baseExp":207,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10071.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10071.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10071.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10071.ogg","genus":"Hermit Crab Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"The SHELLDER that is latched onto SLOWPOKE's tail is said to feed on the host's left over scraps."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Lives lazily by the sea. If the SHELLDER on its tail comes off, it becomes a SLOWPOKE again."},{"version":"gold","text":"If the tail-biting SHELLDER is thrown off in a harsh battle, it reverts to being an ordi­ nary SLOWPOKE."},{"version":"silver","text":"Naturally dull to begin with, it lost its ability to feel pain due to SHELLDER's seeping poison."},{"version":"crystal","text":"An attached SHELLDER won't let go because of the tasty flavor that oozes out of its tail."},{"version":"ruby","text":"SLOWBRO’s tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes SLOWBRO to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This forces it to reluctantly swim and catch prey."},{"version":"firered","text":"When a SLOWPOKE went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a SHELLDER. That made it evolve into SLOWBRO."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"The SHELLDER that latches onto SLOWPOKE’s tail is said to feed on the host’s leftover scraps."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"If the tail-biting SHELLDER is thrown off in a harsh battle, it reverts to being an ordinary SLOWPOKE."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Naturally dull to begin with, it lost its ability to feel pain due to SHELLDER’s seeping poison."},{"version":"black","text":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down."},{"version":"x","text":"An attached Shellder won’t let go because of the tasty flavor that oozes out of its tail."},{"version":"y","text":"When a Slowpoke went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a Shellder. That made it evolve into Slowbro."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Slowbro’s tail has a Shellder firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes Slowbro to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead."},{"version":"sun","text":"It spaces out while gazing at the sea. With Shellder’s poison flowing through its body, it becomes even spacier."},{"version":"moon","text":"Whenever Shellder bites down hard on its tail, it gives Slowbro a flash of inspiration...which it forgets a moment later."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Spacing out is basically all it does. It turns back into Slowpoke if its tail, along with Shellder, breaks off."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Shellder, in its greed to suck out more and more sweetness from Slowbro’s tail, has metamorphosed into a spiral-shaped shell."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Lives lazily by the sea. If the Shellder on its tail comes off, it becomes a Slowpoke again."},{"version":"sword","text":"Slowpoke became Slowbro when a Shellder bit on to its tail. Sweet flavors seeping from the tail make the Shellder feel as if its life is a dream."},{"version":"shield","text":"Being bitten by a Shellder shocked this Pokémon into standing on two legs. If the Shellder lets go, it seems Slowbro will turn back into a Slowpoke."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups":["monster","water1"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"slowpoke","speciesId":79,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 37","Usar Galarica Cuff"],"species":"slowbro","speciesId":80,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Troca, Segurando Kings Rock","Usar Galarica Wreath"],"species":"slowking","speciesId":199,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":80,"name":"slowbro","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/80.png"},{"id":10071,"name":"slowbro-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10071.png"},{"id":10165,"name":"slowbro-galar","form":"galarian","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10165.png"}],"games":[16,17,18,19],"moves":[{"id":6,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":23,"learn":[[19,"lv",1]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[16,"lv",23],[17,"lv",23],[18,"lv",23],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[19,"lv",1]]},{"id":45,"learn":[[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",5],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",5],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",5],[19,"lv",1],[19,"lv",6]]},{"id":50,"learn":[[16,"lv",19],[17,"lv",19],[18,"lv",19],[19,"lv",24]]},{"id":53,"learn":[[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":55,"learn":[[16,"lv",9],[17,"lv",9],[18,"lv",9],[19,"lv",1],[19,"lv",12]]},{"id":57,"learn":[[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"lv",36],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":58,"learn":[[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":59,"learn":[[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":69,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":70,"learn":[